ual post display\\\\n- Category/tag system\\\\n- Archive functionality\\\\n- RSS feed generation\\\\n\\\\n**PHASE 6: Resident Portal**\\\\n- Secure login page\\\\n- Password reset functionality\\\\n- Resident dashboard\\\\n- Document repository (HOA documents, meeting minutes)\\\\n- Announcement system for residents\\\\n- Profile management\\\\n- Session management and security\\\\n\\\\n**PHASE 7: Administrative Backend**\\\\n- Admin dashboard\\\\n- User management interface\\\\n- Content management capabilities\\\\n- System settings and configuration\\\\n- Backup procedures documentation\\\\n\\\\n**PHASE 8: Testing & Deployment**\\\\n- Unit testing implementation\\\\n- Integration testing\\\\n- Security audit\\\\n- Performance optimization\\\\n- Deployment configuration\\\\n- Production environment setup\\\\n- DNS and hosting configuration\\\\n\\\\n**Key Features Breakdown:**\\\\n1. **Public Pages**: Home, About, Amenities, Rules, Gallery, Contact\\\\n2. **Secure Portal**: Login, Dashboard, Documents, Announcements, Profile\\\\n3. **Blog System**: Posts, Categories, Archives, Admin Interface\\\\n4. **Contact Form**: Validation, Email Integration, Spam Protection\\\\n5. **Admin Panel**: User Management, Content Management, System Settings\\\\n\\\\nThis structure provides clear separation of concerns and ensures dependencies are built in the correct order. Each phase builds upon the previous one, minimizing rework and ensuring a solid foundation for subsequent features.\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderSequenceID\\\": \\\"DPM-001\\\"\\n}\\n###DPM-001-REPORT###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###DPM-002###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Delta (d0e2efeb-6e25-4edd-83ea-6394c2f9bd6a)\\nTo: 0c72168b-23e1-4e01-89d0-9e1a9ab1dc2f\\nType: Orders\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"[Orders from Delta (d0e2efeb-6e25-4edd-83ea-6394c2f9bd6a) to Grymm (0c72168b-23e1-4e01-89d0-9e1a9ab1dc2f) with sequence ID DPM-002:\\\\n\\\\n]This is the final order of the Planning Phase. Your task 